  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards now use dedicated source-direct full-body image nodes instead of the engine face-crop resolver. Their encyclopedia-only geometry is calibrated against Briar's finished 58px visible-body class, with feet kept above the native tier selector; battle, BP and compact portrait cameras are unchanged. Yone's reference-grounded eight-frame upright run keeps the accepted moderate stride and alternating limbs, while the wider second contact beat is restrained so the second half-cycle no longer lands as a heavier limp. Fate Sealed keeps its staged wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo presentation aligned to the real rush tick. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required only for the previously introduced current Yone action tree.",
